    "sub_name": "全球在地化與品牌行銷",
    "sub_ename": "GOLOCALIZATION AND BRAND MARKETING",
    "describe_ch": "Glocalization全球在地化，以歷史的審美高度，走向前衛的品牌未來，許多品牌，包括台灣，都在尋找與實踐這一條效率效能的策略之路。以十大工藝時尚品牌作為研究的範圍與結論建議。",
    "describe_eh": "There are many brands searching a strategic path to effectively and efficiently deploying glocalization. This course is designed for students to learn from historical highest aesthetic judgement of reputation related offerings or products and further creating a brand style of avant-garde into the future. It is a creative way of brand marketing.",
