    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "本課程為研究所層級，旨在培養學生對行銷管理中人類行為的全球觀。因此，準時出席與認真閱讀指定教材極為重要。閱讀後的反思將納入評分，引用的句子應被視為你與作者之間的對話。簡報的視覺設計也同樣是評量的一部分。",
    "course_pol_en": "This is a graduate-level course designed to help students develop a global perspective on human behavior in marketing management. Therefore, punctual attendance and thorough engagement with the assigned readings are essential. Reflections on the readings are evaluated, and direct quotations should be treated as your dialogue with the author. The visual appeal of your PowerPoint presentations also plays an important role.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
