    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Plagiarizing intellectual property is a violation of academic integrity. References must be properly presented during oral reports. Be mindful of your critical thinking&mdash;suggestions from OpenAI or similar tools should not dominate your work. Your own creativity and reflective thinking are highly valued. The level of confidence you demonstrate in the content you&rsquo;ve learned and present will be an important factor in your evaluation.</div>\n",
